    "finalName": "",
    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a> on your turn, you can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check against a living creature within 12 squares, removing one use of the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Farseeing\" title=\"Farseeing\">Farseeing</a></i> Force Power from your active <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power_Suite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power Suite\">Force Power Suite</a> (as though you had activated the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>).<br><br>If your check result equals or exceeds the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a> of the target, you gain a +2 insight bonus on attack rolls against that target until the end of your turn. This counts as using the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Farseeing\" title=\"Farseeing\">Farseeing</a></i> Force Power against that target, but this Talent replaces the normal rules and effects of that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>.",
